signed webhooks, a loyalty program, point

66
00:04:32,557 --> 00:04:37,702
of sale, marketing automations
and automated tests with Vitest.

67
00:04:38,302 --> 00:04:40,388
My path combines different layers.

68
00:04:40,388 --> 00:04:45,694
At Dev Dynamos I worked on data modeling,
Figma prototypes and documentation.

69
00:04:45,694 --> 00:04:48,412
At Sicredi I worked in technical support:

70
00:04:48,412 --> 00:04:51,098
